---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Tools
description: "Free bioinformatic web tools by Eugene Koh, including the Plant Expression Omnibus (PEO)."
---
{% from "partials/scenes.njk" import scene %}
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}
{% from "partials/cards.njk" import toolCard %}

<div class="hero-scene hero-scene--page hero-scene--short">
  {{ scene("greenhouse", "tools", label="A glasshouse full of leafy greens on a sunny hillside") }}
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <header class="page-head card">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-icon">{{ icon("tool", 18) }}</span> Tools</p>
    <h1>Tools for the community</h1>
    <p class="lede">Free web resources I've built or helped build, so that any biologist can explore plant gene expression without writing code.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="tool-grid tool-grid--page">
    {% for t in tools %}{{ toolCard(t) }}{% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
